OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire Water boss resigns after
OL,4,Afirm downgraded
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Water's chief executive has
OL,7,Fannounced she is to step down, just 24
OL,8,Fhours after the company was given the
OL,9,Flowest possible environmental rating by
OL,10,Fthe Environment Agency
OL,12,FNicola Shaw, who has led the firm since
OL,13,F2022, will leave the role on 1 January
OL,14,Fto be replaced by Nicola Medalova, a
OL,15,Fchartered environmental health officer
OL,16,Fwho previously worked for the National
OL,17,FGrid.
OL,19,FIn a statement on Friday, Shaw said it
OL,20,Fhad been a "privilege" to lead the
OL,21,Fcompany but that it was "the right
OL,22,Ftime" to leave her post.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
