OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire Water boss resigns after
OL,4,Afirm downgraded
OL,5,
OL,6,FShaw has faced criticism in recent
OL,7,Fyears, including for taking #1.3m in
OL,8,Fundisclosed payments between 2023 and
OL,9,F2025, while the company has come under
OL,10,Fscrutiny for its performance.
